# rooms-devops is read-only

This workspace may include `rooms-devops` beside `Cloudial-Packages`.

1. **Never** edit, commit, deploy from, or reformat files under `rooms-devops`.
2. Use `rooms-devops` only to read Apex/LWC/docs for parity while implementing in `Cloudial-Packages`.
3. All new metadata, skills, manifests, and README updates go under `Cloudial-Packages` only.
